    <briefdescription>
<para>Generic scene that builds its content from a <ref refid="classLevelSystem" kindref="compound">LevelSystem</ref> builder function. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>This scene replaces the old <ref refid="classDemo2DFixedScene" kindref="compound">Demo2DFixedScene</ref> for level-based gameplay. It receives a builder function (e.g., BuildLevel1) and a camera mode, and uses them to construct and run the level. Pressing ESC returns to the level selector.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classLevelSystem" kindref="compound">LevelSystem</ref>, <ref refid="classLevelSelectorScene" kindref="compound">LevelSelectorScene</ref>, <ref refid="classLevelRegistry" kindref="compound">LevelRegistry</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
